WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The chips are still together on the wafer.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
A probe touches the contacts to send signals.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The response shows which can go to assembly.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
The chip and memory pass their own tests.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
Assembly adds a connection that can fail.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
Testing the assembly shows that the signal cannot cross the open connection.
